            "text": "In front of Riverfront Resort, Baan Khlong Sok; Khao Sok National Park, Southern Thailand",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "David Luekens first came to Thailand in 2005 when Thai friends from his former home of Burlington, Vermont led him on a life-changing trip. Based in Thailand since 2011, he spends much of his time eating in Bangkok street markets and island hopping the Andaman Sea. David is also the founder of Thai Island Quest —a newsletter focused on covering every island and beach in Thailand.",
